<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>{{title}} - Geo-Track</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        *, *::before, *::after { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

        :root {
            --navy: #0f2044;
            --navy-mid: #1a3260;
            --teal: #0d9488;
            --teal-light: #14b8a6;
            --slate-light: #f1f5f9;
            --white: #ffffff;
            --text: #1e293b;
            --text-muted: #64748b;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            background: var(--slate-light);
            min-height: 100vh;
        }

        /* Hero */
        .hero {
            background: linear-gradient(160deg, var(--navy) 0%, var(--navy-mid) 60%, #1e4080 100%);
            color: white;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .hero::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            bottom: -120px;
            right: -120px;
            width: 500px;
            height: 500px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: rgba(13, 148, 136, 0.1);
        }

        .hero::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: -80px;
            left: -80px;
            width: 350px;
            height: 350px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
        }

        nav {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            padding: 20px 60px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 10;
        }

        .nav-brand {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .nav-brand-icon {
            width: 40px;
            height: 40px;
            background: var(--teal);
            border-radius: 10px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
        }

        .nav-brand-name {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: white;
        }

        .nav-cta {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            padding: 9px 22px;
            background: var(--teal);
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: background 0.2s, transform 0.15s;
        }

        .nav-cta:hover {
            background: var(--teal-light);
            transform: translateY(-1px);
        }

        .hero-content {
            flex: 1;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 60px 40px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 10;
        }

        .hero-badge {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
            background: rgba(13, 148, 136, 0.2);
            border: 1px solid rgba(13, 148, 136, 0.4);
            color: var(--teal-light);
            padding: 6px 16px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 28px;
        }

        .hero-title {
            font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 5vw, 3.6rem);
            font-weight: 800;
            line-height: 1.15;
            letter-spacing: -1px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .hero-title span {
            color: var(--teal-light);
        }

        .hero-subtitle {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            opacity: 0.75;
            max-width: 520px;
            line-height: 1.7;
            margin-bottom: 44px;
        }

        .hero-actions {
            display: flex;
            gap: 14px;
            justify-content: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .btn-hero-primary {
            padding: 14px 36px;
            background: var(--teal);
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 10px;
            font-size: 1rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: background 0.2s, transform 0.15s, box-shadow 0.2s;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(13, 148, 136, 0.4);
        }

        .btn-hero-primary:hover {
            background: var(--teal-light);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(13, 148, 136, 0.45);
        }

        .btn-hero-secondary {
            padding: 14px 36px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 10px;
            font-size: 1rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
            transition: background 0.2s, transform 0.15s;
        }

        .btn-hero-secondary:hover {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        /* Stats strip */
        .stats-strip {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07);
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            padding: 28px 60px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 60px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 10;
        }

        .stat-item {
            text-align: center;
        }

        .stat-item .num {
            font-size: 1.9rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: var(--teal-light);
        }

        .stat-item .lbl {
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            opacity: 0.65;
            margin-top: 2px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 640px) {
            nav { padding: 16px 24px; }
            .stats-strip { gap: 30px; padding: 20px 24px; }
            .hero-content { padding: 40px 24px; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="hero">
        <nav>
            <div class="nav-brand">
                <div class="nav-brand-icon">🗺️</div>
                <span class="nav-brand-name">Geo-Track</span>
            </div>
            <a href="/login" class="nav-cta">Get Started →</a>
        </nav>

        <div class="hero-content">
            <div class="hero-badge">📍 Municipality of Bansud GIS Platform</div>
            <h1 class="hero-title">Community Service<br><span>Request System</span></h1>
            <p class="hero-subtitle">Submit, track, and monitor community service requests with precise geographic mapping across all barangays of Bansud, Oriental Mindoro.</p>
            <div class="hero-actions">
                <a href="/login" class="btn-hero-primary">Sign In to Your Account</a>
                <a href="/register" class="btn-hero-secondary">Create Account</a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="stats-strip">
            <div class="stat-item">
                <div class="num">13</div>
                <div class="lbl">Barangays Covered</div>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-item">
                <div class="num">8+</div>
                <div class="lbl">Service Categories</div>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-item">
                <div class="num">24/7</div>
                <div class="lbl">Request Monitoring</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
